&lt;p&gt;Family-first policies:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;22 weeks paid maternity/primary carer leave and 6 weeks paid paternity leave.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Financial support:&lt;/p&gt;
