&lt;li&gt;Cycle to Work Scheme and free shuttle buses to/from Hatfield and Welwyn Garden City stations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Exclusive discounts:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;15% off at Ocado.com with free delivery (starting in your first month).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
